{"id":"shiken-patterns","order":1070,"title":{"ja":"四間飛車：基本方針と銀の位置による四つの型","en":"Fourth File Rook: the basic plan and the four silver positions"},"path":["戦法・定跡","四間飛車"],"intro":{"ja":"四間飛車は囲いが堅い一方で、自分から攻める手段が少ない戦法です。方針は、相手の攻めをいなして飛車を交換し、堅さの差で勝負することです。この講座では、基本形と美濃囲いを初手から組み、銀を７八、６七、６六、５六のどこに置くかで狙いがどう変わるかを、盤上で確かめます。","en":"Fourth File Rook has a firm castle but few ways to attack on its own. Its plan is to deflect the opponent's attack, trade rooks and win on the difference in solidity. This lesson builds the basic form and Mino castle from move one and shows on the board how the plan changes with the silver on 7h, 6g, 6f or 5f."},"check":{"question":{"ja":"四間飛車が相手の攻めを待ち、飛車交換を目指すのはなぜですか？","en":"Why does Fourth File Rook wait for the opponent's attack and aim for a rook exchange?"},"answer":{"ja":"飛車を持ち合って攻め合いになれば、同じ条件で戦うことになり、美濃囲いの堅さの分だけ有利になるからです。自分の攻めが薄いので、まず相手の攻めを受けて駒を交換します。","en":"Once both sides hold a rook and trade attacks, the conditions are equal and the Mino castle's solidity tips the balance. Because its own attack is thin, it first absorbs the opponent's attack and trades pieces."}},"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491, All rights reserved)","references":[{"title":"四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い","url":"https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491","license":"All rights reserved","adapted":false}],"courses":[{"id":"lesson-shiken-patterns-1","title":"四間飛車：基本方針と銀の位置による四つの型: 守りの戦法と７八銀型の▲６五歩","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook: the basic plan and the four silver positions: A defensive opening, and ▲6五歩 from the 7h silver form","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"ここからが銀の位置による型の違いです。最初は７八銀のまま戦う７八銀型で、初心者にもわかりやすい形です。▲６五歩と突くと、飛車の前の筋が開き、同時に角道も通ります。飛車先の突破と角交換からの捌きを、一手で両方狙えます。","root":{"id":"n0","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n1","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n2","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n3","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n4","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n5","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n6","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n7","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n8","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7i7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n9","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4a3b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n10","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5i4h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n11","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR1K3/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"9c9d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n12","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1pp/p5p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR1K3/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4h3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n13","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1pp/p5p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2K2/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1c1d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n14","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2K2/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3h2h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n15","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6a5b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n16","sfen":"ln2k1snl/1r1sg1gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3i3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n17","sfen":"ln2k1snl/1r1sg1gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5a4b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n18","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1g1f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n19","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n20","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/p1p3p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6i5h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n21","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/p1p3p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SRG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"9d9e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n22","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/2p3p1p/pp7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SRG1SK1/LN3G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6f6e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n23","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/2p3p1p/pp1P5/2P5P/PPB1PPPP1/2SRG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[],"comment":"ここからが銀の位置による型の違いです。最初は７八銀のまま戦う７八銀型で、初心者にもわかりやすい形です。▲６五歩と突くと、飛車の前の筋が開き、同時に角道も通ります。飛車先の突破と角交換からの捌きを、一手で両方狙えます。","commentEn":"Now the types by silver position. The first leaves the silver on 7h and is the easiest for beginners. ▲6五歩 opens the file in front of the rook and the bishop diagonal at the same time, threatening a rook-file breakthrough and a bishop exchange with one move.","figures":[{"id":"1-4","marks":{"last":"6e","arrows":["6h6f","7g3c"],"boxes":["6e"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"初手から組んだ四間飛車と美濃囲いです。飛車と角は盤の左側、玉と囲いは右側にあり、攻める場所と守る場所がはっきり分かれています。角が飛車と同じ側にいるので、玉の周りに邪魔な駒がなく、深く堅く囲えます。\n居飛車は反対に、角が玉の近くにいて囲いが深くなりにくく、角道を開けた７六歩が守りを薄くします。その代わり、飛車と角が同じ方向を向くので攻撃的です。四間飛車は飛車と角が別の方向を向き、攻めはやや地味ですが、守りは堅いのです。\nですから基本方針は、相手が攻めてくるのを待つことです。受けながら飛車を交換できれば、お互いに飛車を持って敵陣へ打ち込む攻め合いになります。同じ条件なら守りの堅い方が有利で、これが「捌き」です。守るだけで攻めを決められてしまうのは、四間飛車によくある負け方です。","commentEn":"The Fourth File Rook and Mino castle built from move one. Rook and bishop stand on the left, the king and castle on the right, so the place to attack and the place to defend are clearly separated. With the bishop on the rook's side, nothing clutters the king's surroundings and the castle can be deep and firm.\nA Static Rook player is the opposite: the bishop sits near the king, so the castle cannot go deep, and the open bishop diagonal thins the defence. In return, rook and bishop aim the same way and the attack is sharp. Fourth File Rook has rook and bishop pointing in different directions, so the attack is modest but the defence is firm.\nSo the basic plan is to wait for the opponent to attack. If you can trade rooks while defending, both sides hold a rook and drop it into the enemy camp. On equal terms the firmer defence wins. This is called sabaki, settling the attacking pieces by exchange. Being attacked with no counterplay is the usual way Fourth File Rook loses.","figures":[{"id":"1-1","marks":{"boxes":["6h","7g","2h","3h"]}},{"id":"1-2","marks":{"boxes":["7g","6h","2h"]}},{"id":"1-3","marks":{"boxes":["6h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-patterns-2","title":"四間飛車：基本方針と銀の位置による四つの型: ６七銀型：飛車を振り直す","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook: the basic plan and the four silver positions: The 6g silver: re-swinging the rook","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"▲６七銀と銀を上げると、四間飛車のいちばん基本的な形になります。６七の銀は飛車の前を塞ぐので、飛車は動きにくく見えます。この形はそれを逆に使い、飛車を別の筋へ振り直す準備になっています。\n狙いは、飛車を振り直して相手の飛車の正面にぶつけることです。飛車が向かい合えば交換になりやすく、堅い美濃囲いが活きます。７八銀型で要領をつかんだら、次はこの型を身につけると、四間飛車の本筋が指せるようになります。","root":{"id":"n24","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n25","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n26","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n27","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n28","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n29","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n30","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n31","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7a6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n32","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7i7h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n33","sfen":"ln1gkgsnl/1r1s3b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4a3b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n34","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR5/LN1GKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5i4h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n35","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR1K3/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"9c9d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n36","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1pp/p5p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR1K3/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"4h3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n37","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1pp/p5p2/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2K2/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1c1d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n38","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2K2/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3h2h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n39","sfen":"ln1gk1snl/1r1s2gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6a5b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n40","sfen":"ln2k1snl/1r1sg1gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR3K1/LN1G1GSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3i3h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n41","sfen":"ln2k1snl/1r1sg1gb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5a4b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n42","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP5/PPB1PPPPP/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"1g1f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n43","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/2pppp1p1/p5p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7c7d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n44","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/p1p3p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SR2SK1/LN1G1G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6i5h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n45","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/p1p3p1p/1p7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SRG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"9d9e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n46","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/2p3p1p/pp7/2PP4P/PPB1PPPP1/2SRG1SK1/LN3G1NL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7h6g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n47","sfen":"ln4snl/1r1sgkgb1/3ppp1p1/2p3p1p/pp7/2PP4P/PPBSPPPP1/3RG1SK1/LN3G1NL w - 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲６七銀と銀を上げると、四間飛車のいちばん基本的な形になります。６七の銀は飛車の前を塞ぐので、飛車は動きにくく見えます。この形はそれを逆に使い、飛車を別の筋へ振り直す準備になっています。\n狙いは、飛車を振り直して相手の飛車の正面にぶつけることです。飛車が向かい合えば交換になりやすく、堅い美濃囲いが活きます。７八銀型で要領をつかんだら、次はこの型を身につけると、四間飛車の本筋が指せるようになります。","commentEn":"▲6七銀 gives the most basic Fourth File Rook shape. The silver blocks the rook's path, so the rook looks cramped, but the form is built to use that: it prepares to re-swing the rook to another file.\nThe aim is to swing the rook again so that it faces the opponent's rook. Rooks that face each other are easily exchanged, and then the firm Mino castle pays off. Once you have the feel of the 7h form, learn this one next and you can play the main line of Fourth File Rook.","figures":[{"id":"2-2","marks":{"last":"6g","boxes":["6g"]}},{"id":"2-3","marks":{"arrows":["6h8h"],"boxes":["8h"]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"７八銀型の形です。ここから銀の位置を変えて、ほかの型へ進みます。","commentEn":"The 7h-silver form. From here the silver moves to reach the other types.","figures":[{"id":"2-1","marks":{"boxes":["7h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-patterns-3","title":"四間飛車：基本方針と銀の位置による四つの型: ６六銀型と中飛車への振り直し","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook: the basic plan and the four silver positions: The 6f silver and the switch to Central Rook","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"高美濃に組んだら、▲５八飛と中飛車に振り直します。５筋の歩を▲５六歩と突けば、５五の地点に飛車・銀・角の力が集まります。飛車は５六の歩の後ろ、６六の銀と角が斜めに並んでいます。守りが堅いまま、とても攻撃的な構えになります。","root":{"id":"n48","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n49","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n50","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n51","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n52","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n53","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n54","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n55","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp