n","child":{"id":"n83","sfen":"6snl/1r2gkgb1/l1npsp1p1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2PS1PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2a3c","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n84","sfen":"6s1l/1r2gkgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2PS1PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6h5h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n85","sfen":"6s1l/1r2gkgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2PS1PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/4R1SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5b6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n86","sfen":"6s1l/1r1g1kgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2PS1PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/4R1SK1/LN3G2L b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5g5f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n87","sfen":"6s1l/1r1g1kgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2PSPPP1P/PPB2GNP1/4R1SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[],"comment":"高美濃に組んだら、▲５八飛と中飛車に振り直します。５筋の歩を▲５六歩と突けば、５五の地点に飛車・銀・角の力が集まります。飛車は５六の歩の後ろ、６六の銀と角が斜めに並んでいます。守りが堅いまま、とても攻撃的な構えになります。","commentEn":"With Taka Mino complete, re-swing to Central Rook with ▲5八飛. After ▲5六歩, the power of rook, silver and bishop gathers on 5e: the rook behind the pawn on 5f, and the silver on 6f with the bishop behind it on the diagonal. The castle stays firm while the setup becomes very aggressive.","figures":[{"id":"3-4","marks":{"last":"5f","arrows":["5f5e","6f5e"],"boxes":["5e"]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"ここから囲いを高美濃に組み替えます。４筋と３筋の歩を突き、▲４七金と上がって▲３七桂と跳ねる形です。組み替えている間も、銀は６六で前線を支えています。","commentEn":"From here the castle is rebuilt into Taka Mino: the fourth and third file pawns advance, the gold goes to 4g and the knight jumps to 3g. During the rebuild the silver on 6f holds the front.","figures":[{"id":"3-3","marks":{"last":"3g","arrows":["5h4g","2i3g"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲６五歩と突いてから▲６六銀と出る形が６六銀型です。銀が前に出て、棒銀のように攻めを組み立てられます。守りを固めている相手に使う、四間飛車では少し攻撃的な型です。","commentEn":"Pushing ▲6五歩 and then bringing the silver to 6f gives the 6f-silver form. With the silver forward, you can build an attack like Bogin. It is a rather aggressive type for Fourth File Rook, used against an opponent who is only fortifying.","figures":[{"id":"3-2","marks":{"last":"6f","arrows":["6f5e"],"boxes":["6e"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"同じく、７八銀型から出発します。相手が守りを固めるだけで攻めてこないときは、こちらから銀を繰り出して攻める選択肢があります。","commentEn":"Again starting from the 7h form. When the opponent only fortifies and does not attack, you can take the initiative and bring the silver forward.","figures":[{"id":"3-1","marks":{"boxes":["7h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}},{"id":"lesson-shiken-patterns-4","title":"四間飛車：基本方針と銀の位置による四つの型: ５六銀型と右側への攻め","titleEn":"Fourth File Rook: the basic plan and the four silver positions: The 5f silver and the attack on the right wing","myStrategy":"lesson","opponentStrategy":"lesson","mySide":"sente","userSide":"sente","noEngine":true,"source":"この講座のために書き下ろした解説と局面です。\n参考: 四間飛車の基本方針、銀の位置で変わる狙い (https://shogi-joutatsu.com/archives/2491, All rights reserved)","goalFormation":"▲４五銀と▲２五桂が決まりました。角は７七から、銀は４五から、桂は２五から、どれも相手の右側を狙っています。居飛車は右側に玉の囲いがあることが多く、飛車を使わなくても玉に直接迫る厳しい攻めになります。もちろん５六銀型は、局面に応じて普通に組んでもかまいません。","root":{"id":"n88","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/9/PPPPPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"7g7f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n89","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/ppppppppp/9/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8c8d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n90","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B5R1/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2h6h","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n91","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/1p7/9/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8d8e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n92","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PP1PPPPPP/1B1R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"8h7g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n93","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1ppppppp/9/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3c3d","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n94","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p7/2P6/PPBPPPPPP/3R5/LNSGKGSNL b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"6g6f","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n95","sfen":"lnsgkgsnl/1r5b1/p1pppp1pp/6p2/1p