3g","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n123","sfen":"6snl/1r2gkgb1/l1npsp1p1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2P1SPP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5b6b","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n124","sfen":"6snl/1r1g1kgb1/l1npsp1p1/2p1p1p2/pp1P4p/2P1SPP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"5f4e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n125","sfen":"6snl/1r1g1kgb1/l1npsp1p1/2p1p1p2/pp1P1S2p/2P2PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[{"usi":"2a3c","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n126","sfen":"6s1l/1r1g1kgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P1S2p/2P2PP1P/PPB1PGNP1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L b - 1","branches":[{"usi":"3g2e","kind":"main","child":{"id":"n127","sfen":"6s1l/1r1g1kgb1/l1npspnp1/2p1p1p2/pp1P1S1Np/2P2PP1P/PPB1PG1P1/3R2SK1/LN3G2L w - 1","branches":[],"comment":"▲４五銀と▲２五桂が決まりました。角は７七から、銀は４五から、桂は２五から、どれも相手の右側を狙っています。居飛車は右側に玉の囲いがあることが多く、飛車を使わなくても玉に直接迫る厳しい攻めになります。もちろん５六銀型は、局面に応じて普通に組んでもかまいません。","commentEn":"▲4五銀 and ▲2五桂 are in place. The bishop from 7g, the silver from 4e and the knight from 2e all aim at the opponent's right wing. A Static Rook player often has the castle on that side, so this is a sharp attack on the king that does not even need the rook. Of course the 5f-silver form can also be built as an ordinary setup when the position calls for it.","figures":[{"id":"4-5","marks":{"last":"2e","arrows":["4e3d","2e3c","7g3c"],"boxes":["4e","2e"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲４七金と▲３七桂で高美濃囲いの形にします。堅さを保ったまま、桂が攻めの駒として使える位置に来ました。","commentEn":"▲4七金 and ▲3七桂 make the Taka Mino shape. The castle stays firm and the knight is now in a position to join the attack.","figures":[{"id":"4-4","marks":{"last":"3g","arrows":["5h4g","2i3g"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"右側を攻めるために、６筋の歩を▲６五歩と進め、▲４六歩、▲３六歩と４筋と３筋の歩も突きます。歩が進むことで、銀や桂が出ていく場所ができます。","commentEn":"To attack on the right, the sixth-file pawn goes up with ▲6五歩 and the fourth and third file pawns follow with ▲4六歩 and ▲3六歩. The advanced pawns make room for the silver and knight to come out.","figures":[{"id":"4-3","marks":{"last":"3f","boxes":["4e","2e"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"▲６七銀から▲５六銀と出ると、５六銀型です。銀が５六の歩の位置に腰掛ける形で、相手玉のいる右側へ向かって進んでいけます。","commentEn":"▲6七銀 followed by ▲5六銀 gives the 5f-silver form. The silver sits on 5f and can head to the right wing, where the opponent's king is.","figures":[{"id":"4-2","marks":{"last":"5f","arrows":["5f4e"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}],"comment":"最後の型です。７八銀型から、銀をもっと右へ回します。","commentEn":"The last type. From the 7h form, the silver goes further to the right.","figures":[{"id":"4-1","marks":{"boxes":["7h"]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}}]}